'''Seaside Pegasa''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] gacha event. She is an anti-[[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Pegasa (Uber Rare Cat)|Pegasa]] that was added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

