==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], [[First-Love Myrcia (Uber Rare Cat)|First-Love Myrcia]], [[Night Beach Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Night Beach Lilin]], [[Reindeer Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Reindeer Terun]], [[Music Fest Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Music Fest Thundia]], and Seaside Pegasa's Evolved Forms were missing the ", type" part of their names that other Galaxy Gals had.
*Seaside Pegasa's Evolved Form name is inconsistent with her normal variants, in that it uses "v" instead of the Greek letter "ν" (nu). This inconsistency is shared with [[Tropical Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Tropical Kalisa]] and [[Floral Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Floral Kalisa]].
*Seaside Pegasa is currently the only seasonal unit with the [[Conjure]] ability.

